del-slug="gpt-5-6-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="27">对，截图说明<strong data-start="6" data-end="16">已经提交成功</strong>。现在上传三张新图片。</p>
<p data-start="29" data-end="50">先下载这三张已经压缩好的 WebP 图片：</p>
<ul data-start="52" data-end="303">
<li data-section-id="1jdp5zd" data-start="52" data-end="133">
<p data-start="54" data-end="133"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">下载生产能力图片</button></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1t492nt" data-start="134" data-end="216">
<p data-start="136" data-end="216"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">下载质量检查图片</button></span></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="y99ysi" data-start="217" data-end="303">
<p data-start="219" data-end="303"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">下载仓储出货图片</button></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="305" data-end="313">然后按下面操作：</p>
<ol data-start="315" data-end="434">
<li data-section-id="1nz9rkw" data-start="315" data-end="358">
<p data-start="318" data-end="358">点击页面左上方蓝色的 <strong data-start="329" data-end="350"><code data-start="331" data-end="348">wak-filter-site</code></strong>，返回仓库首页。</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="m09ev2" data-start="359" data-end="378">
<p data-start="362" data-end="378">点击 <strong data-start="365" data-end="377">Add file</strong>。</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1y8t0b0" data-start="379" data-end="402">
<p data-start="382" data-end="402">选择 <strong data-start="385" data-end="401">Upload files</strong>。</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c7lh2m" data-start="403" data-end="421">
<p data-start="406" data-end="421">把刚下载的三张图片一起拖进去。</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ikezzo" data-start="422" data-end="434">
<p data-start="425" data-end="434">确认文件名保持为：</p>
</li>
</ol>
