<p data-start="35" data-end="51">我已经处理成适合网站使用的格式：</p>
<ul data-start="53" data-end="129">
<li data-section-id="1giymog" data-start="53" data-end="68">
<p data-start="55" data-end="68">尺寸：1200 × 675</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ioonwh" data-start="69" data-end="78">
<p data-start="71" data-end="78">格式：WebP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1jh6zjs" data-start="79" data-end="118">
<p data-start="81" data-end="118" class="" style="">文件名：<code data-start="85" data-end="118">quality-inspection-process.webp</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dyx0n0" data-start="119" data-end="129">
<p data-start="121" data-end="129">大小约：81KB</p>
</li>
</ul>
