usually work at US farmers markets. Ask my state only if needed.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple trail-day packing card image with icons for water, layers, map, snacks, sunscreen, and a trash bag. Keep it text-light.\",\"title\":\"Create a simple trail-day card\"},{\"title\":\"Build a World Cup watch plan\",\"body\":\"Use the latest World Cup schedule to suggest the next matches worth watching. Ask my time zone if you need it.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple cooler-packing diagram for a cookout, with clear zones for drinks, raw items, ready-to-eat food, and ice.\",\"title\":\"Make a cooler packing diagram\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me a tricky topic using everyday analogies, a tiny story, and three quick questions. Ask me the topic first.\",\"title\":\"Explain it with silly analogies\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan a July 4 cookout timeline. Ask what I’m serving, then make a simple prep schedule with food-safety reminders.\",\"title\":\"Plan a calmer July 4 cookout\"},{\"title\":\"Prep for hurricane season\",\"body\":\"Build a hurricane-season prep checklist I can finish in stages, with home supplies, documents, alerts, and evacuation basics.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a Summerween movie night\",\"body\":\"Plan a cozy Summerween movie night with slasher-lite picks, creepy snacks, and a no-gore option for mixed tastes.\"},{\"title\":\"Prepare a customer service call\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare for a customer service call. Ask what I need resolved, then draft a calm opening script and key notes to keep handy.\"},{\"body\":\"Help me turn a messy list of ideas into playful folders, tags, and next actions. I’ll paste the list.\",\"title\":\"Sort my messy idea list\"},{\"title\":\"Set up home maintenance\",\"body\":\"Help me make a seasonal home maintenance plan. Ask what kind of place I’m maintaining, then suggest the first month.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a farmers market haul\",\"body\":\"Help me plan a farmers market trip near me. Ask for my ZIP code, then suggest in-season buys and two simple meals from them.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a clean, text-light image for a soccer watch-party bracket board with blank team slots and simple soccer icons.\",\"title\":\"Make a match-day bracket board\"},{\"title\":\"Pick your iced café drink\",\"body\":\"Help me choose between iced hōjicha, horchata, and einspänner vibes. Ask my flavor preference, then give a home version.\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a World Cup watch party\",\"body\":\"Help me plan a low-effort World Cup watch party. Ask which match I’m watching, then make a menu, timeline, and conversation starters.\"},{\"title\":\"Find a vacation read\",\"body\":\"Help me choose a vacation read. Ask one question about the mood I want, then suggest current options and explain the appeal.\"},{\"title\":\"Map room zones\",\"body\":\"Create an image of a simple room zone map from my description, using blocks, arrows, and blank labels. Make it practical, not decorative.\"},{\"title\":\"Decode Wimbledon scoring\",\"body\":\"Teach me Wimbledon scoring like I’m joining a casual watch party, then quiz me with three silly point-by-point examples.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple image of a festival packing board with icon-only sections for weather, hydration, phone, earplugs, and transit.\",\"title\":\"Make a festival packing board\"},{\"body\":\"Upload a pantry photo or list a few ingredients. Teach me one flexible meal formula I can use tonight and explain why the steps work.\",\"title\":\"Learn a pantry meal formula\"},{\"body\":\"Decode this summer’s “maxxing” trend words in plain English and help me decide which ones are useful versus just noise.\",\"title\":\"Decode summer trend words\"},{\"title\":\"Make chores feel like a quest\",\"body\":\"Turn my chores into a 30-minute mini-quest with a timer plan, side quests, and a finish line. Ask me what needs doing first.\"},{\"title\":\"Pick a summer movie\",\"body\":\"Help me pick a summer movie to see in theaters. Compare mood, theater value, spoiler risk, and who each pick is best for.\"},{\"title\":\"Understand fibermaxxing\",\"body\":\"Explain the fibermaxxing trend in a balanced way, including what fiber does and why sudden big changes can backfire.\"},{\"body\":\"Ask for my city, then create a text-light fridge guide image with simple icons for recycling, trash, compost, and drop-off items.\",\"title\":\"Make a bin icon guide\"},{\"title\":\"Plan a World Cup watch party\",\"body\":\"Help me host a World Cup watch party. Give me a low-effort food plan, a simple match explainer, and one conversation starter for guests.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a sorting map\",\"body\":\"Create an image of a simple icon-based sorting map for my messy spot. I can upload a photo or describe it. Leave labels blank.\"},{\"title\":\"Understand timed entry\",\"body\":\"Teach me how timed entry works at busy US parks, what details to check, and why a pass and a reservation may be different.\"},{\"title\":\"Prep for hurricane season\",\"body\":\"Help me make a hurricane-season plan for my home. Ask for my ZIP code first, then tailor a supply list, document backup, and evacuation notes.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a simple text-light recycling sorting guide with generic icons and blank labels I can fill in after checking my city’s rules.\",\"title\":\"Make a bin sorting guide\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me what the Tour de France jerseys mean and how mountain, sprint, and time trial stages change the race.\",\"title\":\"Decode Tour de France jerseys\"},{\"body\":\"Explain the 2026 Atlantic hurricane season outlook in plain English and ask whether I’m coastal, inland, or flood-prone before making a prep plan.\",\"title\":\"Understand hurricane alerts\"},{\"title\":\"Make a park-day card\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light park-day card for Rocky Mountain National Park with icons for permit, pass, water, layers, and a phone screenshot.\"},{\"title\":\"Play Declaration detective\",\"body\":\"Turn the Declaration’s 250th anniversary into a playful history detective game with 5 clues, plain-English answers, and no lecture.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a 250-year time capsule\",\"body\":\"Help me make a playful America250 time capsule prompt list for July 4, with questions people can answer in under a minute.\"},{\"title\":\"Catch up on the World Cup\",\"body\":\"Help me pick one World Cup match to watch this week. Explain the teams, stakes, and key players for a newer soccer fan in the US.\"},{\"title\":\"Draft a summer anthem clip\",\"body\":\"Give me a low-lift 7-second summer anthem video idea with on-screen text options, a shot list, and a caption that avoids cringe.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a Tour snack passport\",\"body\":\"Create a playful Tour de France snack passport I can use while watching, with stage-day prompts and space to rate each bite.\"},{\"title\":\"Make library bingo\",\"body\":\"Turn my to-read pile into a playful summer reading bingo card. Ask for my first few books if you need them.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a World Cup tracker\",\"body\":\"Create a clean, text-light printable match tracker for the World Cup knockout rounds with blank spaces for teams and scores.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain the Summerween trend and give me a low-scare guide to slasher movie terms, without spoilers.\",\"title\":\"Decode Summerween movies\"},{\"body\":\"Teach me how to compare grocery unit prices when labels use ounces, pounds, sheets, or counts. Give a quick practice example.\",\"title\":\"Compare grocery unit prices\"},{\"title\":\"Learn Wimbledon scoring\",\"body\":\"Teach me Wimbledon scoring in plain English, including sets, tiebreaks, and the terms I’ll hear most while watching.\"},{\"body\":\"Create a text-light image of a soccer watch-party snack board with blank labels. Ask my snack style first and avoid logos.\",\"title\":\"Create a match-day snack board\"},{\"body\":\"Help me plan a low-key potluck with a playful theme, easy food categories, and a simple host timeline. Ask me the date and guest count first.\",\"title\":\"Plan a low-key potluck\"},{\"body\":\"Run a short interview practice for a role I’m applying to. Ask me for the job title, then give one question and feedback at a time.\",\"title\":\"Practice interview answers\"},{\"title\":\"Make a day-trip map card\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light visual day-trip card with a route shape, stops, and timing blocks. Ask me for my starting city and trip vibe first.\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Tour de France stages\",\"body\":\"Help me choose a few Tour de France stages to watch this year based on drama, scenery, sprint finishes, and mountain days.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain why flip-flops and slides trend every summer, then compare comfort, styling, and when each one makes sense.\",\"title\":\"Compare slides and flip-flops\"},{\"body\":\"Create a clean, text-light tennis scorecard image with blank rows for sets and tiny court icons.\",\"title\":\"Create a tennis scorecard\"},{\"title\":\"Make a day-out mood board\",\"body\":\"Create an image of a text-light mood board for a playful day out. Ask me for the city first, then use simple icons and no logos.\"}]},\"is_device_based\":true,\"passed\":true},\"2921297473\":{\"name\":\"2921297473\",\"rule_id\":\"launchedGroup\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":37,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"enabled\":true},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Test\",\"is_experiment_active\":false,\"is_user_in_experiment\":false},\"1165494509\":{\"name\":\"1165494509\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":16,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"name\":\"phone_number\",\"loginStrategy\":\"existing_user\",\"kind\":\"username\",\"enabled\":true,\"tempDisabled\":false},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"2674049786\":{\"name\":\"2674049786\",\"rule_id\":\"2bhHmL2CqQhKvw90VC7VjR\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":20,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"variant\":\"control\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"Control\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true},\"2433713709